sequenceDiagram

    actor Employee
    participant Client as MAUI / Web Client
    participant API as Transactions API (/api/transactions)
    participant Service as Unified Transactions Service
    participant DB as SQL Server 2022
    participant Audit as Audit Service
    participant Notify as Notification Service

    Employee->>Client: Enter advance request details
    Client->>API: POST /api/transactions/advances
    API->>API: Authenticate JWT & authorize permission
    API->>Service: Submit advance request
    Service->>Service: Validate input fields (Amount > 0, Purpose)
    Service->>DB: Save AdvanceRequest (Status = Pending)
    DB-->>Service: Saved
    Service->>Audit: Record creation event
    Service->>Notify: Send alert to Manager / Super Admin
    Service-->>API: Advance created
    API-->>Client: Success (201 Created) + Pending status
    Client-->>Employee: Display request pending approval